#: rc.cpp:3
msgid "&Enable the sound system"
msgstr "&Klangsysteem anmaken"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generaltab.ui line 43
#: rc.cpp:6
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, the sound system will be loaded on KDE startup.\n"
"Recommended if you want sound."
msgstr ""
"Wenn aktiveert, warrt dat Klangsysteem bi't Hoochfohren vun KDE start.\n"
"Anraadt, wenn Du Kläng bruken wullt."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generaltab.ui line 65
#: rc.cpp:10
msgid "Networked Sound"
msgstr "Kläng över Nettwark"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generaltab.ui line 76
#: rc.cpp:13
msgid ""
"<i>Enable this option if you want to play sound on a remote computer or you "
"want to be able to control sound on this system from another computer.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>Aktiveer dit, wenn du Kläng op en anner Reekner afspelen oder Kläng op "
"dissen Reekner vun en anner Systeem ut kuntrulleren wullt.</i>"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generaltab.ui line 84
#: rc.cpp:16
msgid "Enable &networked sound"
msgstr "Kläng över &Nettwark anmaken"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generaltab.ui line 87
#: rc.cpp:19
msgid ""
"This option allows sound requests coming in from over the network to be "
"accepted, instead of just limiting the server to the local computer."
msgstr ""
"Wenn aktiveert, köönt Klangbefehlen, de över dat Nettwark kummt, utföhrt "
"warrn. Anners nimmt de Server bloots Befehlen vun dissen Reekner an."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generaltab.ui line 97
#: rc.cpp:22
msgid "Skip Prevention"
msgstr "Pausverhöden"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generaltab.ui line 108
#: rc.cpp:25
msgid ""
"<i>If your sound is skipping during playback, enable running with highest "
"possible priority. Increasing your sound buffer might also help.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>Wenn dat lütte Pausen bi't Afspelen gifft, aktiveer dat Lopen mit "
"Echttietprioriteet. Den Klangpuffer grötter to maken mag ok hölpen.</i>"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generaltab.ui line 116
#: rc.cpp:28
msgid "&Run with the highest possible priority (realtime priority)"
msgstr "Mit de &hööchste möögliche Prioriteet lopen (Echttietprioriteet)"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generaltab.ui line 122
#: rc.cpp:31
msgid ""
"On systems which support realtime scheduling, if you have sufficient "
"permissions, this option will enable a very high priority for processing "
"sound requests."
msgstr ""
"Op Systemen, de Echttietplanen ünnerstütt, warrt mit disse Optschoon en "
"bannig hoge Prioriteet för de Klangverarbeiden anmaakt, wenn Du de richtigen "
"Verlöven hest."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generaltab.ui line 153
#: rc.cpp:34
msgid "Sound &buffer:"
msgstr "Klang&puffer:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generaltab.ui line 164
#: rc.cpp:37
msgid ""
"<p align=\"right\"><b>Huge</b> buffer, for <b>low-end</b> machines, <b>less "
"skipping</b></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p align=\"right\"><b>Groot</b> Puffer, för <b>langsam</b> Reekners, "
"<b>weniger Pausen</b></p>"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generaltab.ui line 174
#: rc.cpp:40
msgid "Auto-Suspend"
msgstr "Automaatsch utmaken"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generaltab.ui line 185
#: rc.cpp:43
msgid ""
"<i>The KDE sound system takes exclusive control over your audio hardware, "
"blocking programs that may wish to use it directly. If the KDE sound system "
"sits idle it can give up this exclusive control.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>Dat KDE-Klangsysteem övernimmt de utsluten Kuntrull över Dien Klang-"
"Hardware, un blockeert anner Programmen, de direktemang dor op togriepen "
"wullt. Wenn dat Klangsysteem nix to doon hett, kann dat disse Kuntrull aver "
"ok opgeven.</i>"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generaltab.ui line 204
#: rc.cpp:46
msgid "&Auto-suspend if idle after:"
msgstr "&Utmaken, wenn nix daan över:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generaltab.ui line 210
#: rc.cpp:49
msgid "The sound server will suspend itself if idle for this period of time."
msgstr ""
"De Klangsysteem warrt sik sülven utmaken, wenn dat över disse Tiet nix daan "
"hett."

